            <br /><br />
            <strong>Multiplayer:</strong><br />
            ArmaLand consists of several servers hosted on our servers for multiplayer games that we have created; it is the main server accessible by clicking on "Quick Play."
            <br /><br />
            For other servers (e.g., Team Fortress 2) where we have an ArmaLand server, please be aware that these servers can be terminated at any time at the request of the original creators.
            <br /><br />
            It is important to note that each game with a dedicated server that we host is subject to specific rules. Please be aware that these rules can change at any time.
        </p>
